  "description": "Reid Comfort 2 | Comfort hybrid bike\n\nComfortable, accessible and built for relaxed everyday riding – the ideal bike for leisurely journeys, exploring local routes and enjoying longer rides at your own pace.\n\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 2 is designed to make cycling easy and enjoyable, combining a relaxed riding position with comfort-focused components for a smooth, confidence-inspiring ride. With its upright geometry and practical setup, it’s an ideal choice for getting around town, exploring cycle paths and enjoying casual rides.\n\nIts 27.5” double-wall alloy rims are paired with wide 2.35” all-terrain tyres to provide a stable, cushioned ride across a variety of surfaces. An 80mm travel suspension fork helps absorb bumps and vibrations, reducing the impact felt through the bike and making uneven paths more comfortable to ride.\n\nA Shimano 21-speed Tourney drivetrain with Revoshift shifters gives you a wide range of gearing options for tackling hills, flat roads and varied terrain. Lightweight alloy V-brakes provide controlled stopping power, while ergonomic handlebars, comfortable grips and a supportive comfort saddle help reduce fatigue on longer journeys.\n\nAvailable as part of the Reid Bikes Comfort range, which includes both standard and low-step models, the Comfort 2 offers an accessible, rider-friendly design that puts comfort first. Its combination of practical features, versatile performance and excellent value makes it a great way to enjoy cycling with less effort.\n\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 2 is ideal for:\n\nEveryday leisure riding, with a relaxed, upright riding position for comfortable journeys around town\n\nRiders exploring varied terrain, thanks to 2.35” all-terrain tyres that provide a stable, cushioned ride\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with an 80mm suspension fork, ergonomic handlebars, ergo grips and a supportive saddle\n\nRiders tackling hills and longer routes, with Shimano 21-speed Tourney gearing for a versatile range of riding options\n\nConfident everyday stopping, with lightweight alloy V-brakes for controlled braking\n\nCyclists looking for a smooth ride, with 27.5” double-wall alloy rims and wide tyres to help absorb the bumps of everyday riding\n\nRiders seeking comfort and accessibility, with the Reid Comfort range offering standard and low-step frame options\n\nAnyone looking for quality and value, with a practical, comfortable bike that makes it easy to get out and enjoy more time on two wheels",
